    slug: "gmb-daddy-launches-google-maps-zero-click-blueprint-for",
    title: "GMB Daddy Launches Google Maps Zero-Click Blueprint for Local Service",
    deck: "GMB Daddy study finds that optimized \"zero-click\" Google Maps profiles drive a 38% surge in phone calls for local",
    category: "local-business",
    authorId: "molly-perkins",
    publishedAt: "2026-11-28T01:02:03Z",
    updatedAt: "2026-11-28T01:02:03Z",
