    deck: "Watch OpenAI's Stacey Wang and Craig Bruney, Mary O'Carroll of LECG, and Cooley's Richard Segal explore how AI can help in-house legal teams connect business context, build...",
    category: "ai-tools",
    authorId: "justin-davis",
    publishedAt: "2026-11-23T08:00:00Z",
